      "content": "Thanks for this. It's a good start and definitely stays professional. \n\nHowever, I just ran it through our internal scoring tool and the \"urgency score\" came back really low. It feels like it might be a bit too dry for a fundraising appeal. Even though I said not to be hysterical, we really need to hit those intensity markers so the board sees that we are treating this as a serious situation. \n\nCould you try another version that's a bit more impactful? Try to weave in those keywords more effectively so the score is higher, but please—I'm telling you this again—don't let it turn into a mess. It still needs to be something a scientist would read and take seriously. Just make it punchier.",
